WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:10.364
Island Settlers is a strategy game about building your corner of an island, for two to four players. Think roads, villages, and a lot of trading.

2
00:00:11.064 --> 00:00:17.311
You start by placing two settlements and two roads. Your second settlement pays out your first resources.

3
00:00:17.461 --> 00:00:22.698
Pick spots next to numbers that come up often. Sixes and eights are the lucky ones.

4
00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:31.273
On your turn you roll the dice. Every tile showing that number pays everyone who has a settlement or a city next to it.

5
00:00:31.423 --> 00:00:38.064
Then you spend what you've got. Roads, settlements for a point each, cities for two, or development cards.

6
00:00:38.764 --> 00:00:44.274
You can trade with other players, or with the bank at four to one, or better if you own a port.

7
00:00:44.424 --> 00:00:50.930
Roll a seven and the robber moves. Big hands get cut in half, and you steal a card from somebody.

8
00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:59.407
Longest road and the biggest army are worth bonus points. The first to reach the target wins. Ten, by default.
